<title>SPAIN: Prosegur chairman dies in traffic accident.</title>
<headline>Prosegur chairman dies in traffic accident.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Herberto Gut, chairman of Spanish insurer Prosegur, died on Saturday in a traffic accident on the highway between Madrid and the northern city of Burgos, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The other three passengers in the car were injured and were admitted to hospital, but two have already been released, he said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the chairman's death was an inestimable loss to the group but added that the management of the business was guaranteed under an eight-member team appointed by the board.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
